                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="166" value="i am thinking for the radical left options the army/foreign policy trees will be baked in. with the two dem paths sharing some of the same tree but not all. also maybe a facist tag can be added for the civil war, and you would tag over with a decision. -space" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-4970" y="425" width="470" height="185" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="169" value="(description) The kaiser has long overstreched his authority, this assembly is here at the will of the german people. The kaiser can no longer hold a knife to the will of our nation, the budget will be used as the people have voted. If the Kaiser and his puppets will not relent we will organize a nationwide strike." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-4170" y="317.5" width="499" height="85" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="171" value="(description) The Kaiser has not accepted the calls of his people, he has lost the authority vested in him we must take to the streets to proof our resolve." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-4090" y="480" width="350" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="173" value="(description) the situation in the streets has disolved into anarchy, troops patrol the streets at this rate we are only days away from unavoidable conflict." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-4130" y="560" width="200" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="175" value="(event that fires once finished) (TITLE) {The Frankfurt Massacre} The streets of potsdam are silent, just hours ago troops of the (insert german division) mowed down at least three hundred people. local commanders are now taking matters into their own hands, local soviets are declaring for the revolution nation wide. Luddendorf has made grab for power in hamburg, the Reich is dissolving before our eyes" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-3920" y="580" width="320" height="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="177" value="(description The upcoming budget debate is the clearest opportunity we have to restore the working of our democratic system, we must work to reform our coalitions with similar parties and this will be the great stepping stone for the rights and freedom of the german people." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
